      "prompt": "In an electrolysis experiment, a current of 2.00 A flows through molten AlCl₃ for 1.00 hour. Using Faraday's law (F = 96,485 C/mol e⁻; molar mass Al = 27.0 g/mol), what mass of aluminum is deposited at the cathode?",
