      "prompt": "PASSAGE D: \"What, to the American slave, is your 4th of July? I answer: a day that reveals to him, more than all other days in the year, the gross injustice and cruelty to which he is the constant victim.\" (Frederick Douglass, 1852) — The shift from \"your\" to \"him\" in this passage primarily serves to —",
