      "correctText": "The most important yield of a community garden is the social trust it builds, which is fragile and undervalued.",
      "topic": "Reading: Rhetorical Analysis",
      "explanation": "The whole passage pivots on the metaphor of 'two harvests' — produce and trust — and ends by ranking the second above the first while marking its fragility. That is the thesis.",
