      "explanation": "Je le lui donne (I am giving it to him) is the correct AP French Language double-pronoun order. The order in declarative sentences: me/te/se/nous/vous → le/la/les → lui/leur → y → en. Examples: Je te le donne (I give it to you). Je le leur donne (I give it to them). Je lui en parle (I speak to him about it). Tu m'y emmènes (you take me there). Note: with affirmative commands, the order shifts to verb-direct object-indirect object: Donne-le-moi (Give it to me), Apporte-le-lui (Bring it to him). AP Conventions scoring at 5 rewards mastery of these complex orderings.",
