      "explanation": "The stem 'ama-' + imperfect marker '-ba-' + passive ending '-tur' = 'amabatur,' imperfect passive 3rd singular: 'he/she/it was being loved' or 'used to be loved.' The imperfect signals continuous or habitual past action.",
