      "correctText": "las redes sociales",
      "topic": "Comunidad y Sociedad",
      "explanation": "Las redes sociales is the umbrella term for social media (TikTok, Instagram, WhatsApp, Facebook) on the AP Spanish Language exam. Interpretive audio sources include podcasts and news clips about how redes sociales affect family communication, especially across borders. Vocabulary: publicar (to post), compartir (to share), seguidores (followers), influir (to influence), el ciberacoso (cyberbullying). Verbs of opinion often paired with redes sociales trigger the subjunctive: dudo que las redes sociales mejoren la comunicación, but creo que las redes sociales mejoran la comunicación.",
