      "correctText": "el feminismo",
      "topic": "Gender and LGBTQ+",
      "explanation": "El feminismo and los derechos de la mujer (women's rights) are recurring AP Spanish Language themes. Mexico's #NiUnaMenos protests against femicidio (femicide), Spain's huelga feminista on 8 de marzo (International Women's Day), and the green-bandana movement for derecho al aborto in Argentina all appear in interpretive sources. Vocabulary: la igualdad de género, el patriarcado, el techo de cristal (glass ceiling), el acoso (harassment), la brecha salarial (wage gap). Subjunctive triggers: Es necesario que se respeten los derechos de la mujer. Cultural comparison essays scoring 5 link feminismo hispano with U.S./global movements.",
