      "topic": "Medio Ambiente Global",
      "explanation": "La corrupción is a recurring AP Spanish Language interpretive topic. Sources discuss major scandals: Odebrecht (Brazilian construction firm bribing Latin American officials), case Lava Jato (Brazil and elsewhere), Spanish royal family scandals. Vocabulary: el soborno (bribe), la malversación, el lavado de dinero (money laundering), la impunidad, los políticos corruptos, las investigaciones. Useful expressions: denunciar la corrupción, exigir transparencia, combatir la impunidad. Subjunctive triggers: Es urgente que se combata la corrupción. Cultural comparison essays scoring 5 connect corruption to broader institutional weaknesses and reforms.",
