      "correctText": "las metas personales",
      "topic": "Multiculturalismo",
      "explanation": "Las metas personales and los objetivos personales appear constantly on AP Spanish Language interpersonal speaking prompts and presentational essays. Common verbs: alcanzar (to reach), cumplir (to fulfill), lograr (to achieve), proponerse (to set for oneself). The future tense and conditional combine well here: En cinco años, seré médico. Si pudiera, viajaría por el mundo. Subjunctive triggers with metas include: Espero que pueda alcanzar mis metas. Quiero que mis hijos cumplan sus sueños. AP Language Use rewards mixing future, conditional, and subjunctive in goal statements.",
