      "topic": "Ocio y Deportes",
      "explanation": "El turismo and los viajes are central AP Spanish Language interpretive topics. Spain is one of the world's top tourist destinations (>80 million visitors/year); México, Argentina, Costa Rica, and Perú are major Latin American destinations. Vocabulary: el destino, el itinerario, el alojamiento, el albergue (hostel), las atracciones, los monumentos, el patrimonio mundial (World Heritage). Issues: la masificación turística (overtourism), el impacto ambiental, los precios para locales (gentrification). Subjunctive triggers: Es importante que el turismo sea sostenible. Cultural comparison essays scoring 5 examine turismo's costs and benefits.",
