      "topic": "Paz y Conflicto",
      "explanation": "La paz is core AP Spanish Language vocabulary for unit 6. Related: la guerra, el conflicto, la violencia, la mediación, la diplomacia, el armisticio, el tratado de paz. Verbs: firmar la paz, negociar, mediar, reconciliarse, perdonar. Hispanic peace processes include Colombia's 2016 agreement with the FARC, El Salvador's 1992 Chapultepec accords, Guatemala's 1996 peace accords. Useful expressions: poner fin al conflicto, construir la paz, sanar las heridas. Subjunctive triggers: Es esencial que vivamos en paz. Cultural comparison essays scoring 5 examine post-conflict reconciliation strategies.",
