      "correctText": "por",
      "topic": "Por vs. Para",
      "explanation": "Por expresses duration on the AP Spanish Language exam: Estudié por dos horas (I studied for two hours). Mnemonic for por uses: D-R-E-A-M-S: Duration, Reason/cause, Exchange (Pagué diez dólares por el libro), Around/through (Caminé por el parque), Means (por avión, por teléfono), Substitution (Trabajé por ella). Avoid the common error of using para for duration. AP Language Use scores reward correct por/para distinction. Other duration markers: durante (during) can replace por in many contexts: Estudié durante dos horas.",
