      "explanation": "Para expresses purpose, destination, deadline, and recipient on the AP Spanish Language exam. Mnemonic PRODDS: Purpose (Estudio para aprender), Recipient (Este regalo es para ti), Opinion (Para mí, es importante), Deadline (Para el viernes), Destination (Salgo para Madrid), Standard/comparison (Para ser niño, lee bien). Para + infinitive = in order to. AP presentational essays and interpersonal speaking rubrics reward precise para use, especially in expressing opinion (Para mí...) and deadline (Para el lunes próximo...).",
