      "explanation": "La salud mental is a rising AP Spanish Language theme. Sources discuss how Hispanic communities historically stigmatized therapy and antidepressants, but younger generations and celebrities (Bad Bunny, Shakira, soccer stars) speak openly about ansiedad and depresión. Vocabulary: la ansiedad, la depresión, el estrés, el bienestar (well-being), el terapeuta, el psicólogo, los medicamentos. Useful expressions: cuidar la salud mental, buscar ayuda profesional, romper el estigma. Subjunctive triggers: Es importante que la sociedad apoye la salud mental. Cultural comparison essays scoring 5 contrast attitudes toward mental health across cultures.",
