      "correctText": "la pandemia",
      "topic": "Salud y Medicina",
      "explanation": "La pandemia (COVID-19, 2020-) is omnipresent in AP Spanish Language interpretive sources. Vocabulary: el coronavirus, el contagio, los síntomas, la cuarentena, el confinamiento, el distanciamiento social, la mascarilla (mask), las pruebas (testing), las vacunas, los efectos secundarios. Useful expressions: aplanar la curva, la nueva normalidad. AP sources document health, economic, and educational impacts on Spanish-speaking countries, especially in low-income communities. Subjunctive triggers: Es importante que aprendamos de la pandemia. Cultural comparison essays scoring 5 examine how different Hispanic countries managed the crisis.",
