      "explanation": "El subjuntivo is the AP Spanish Language mood for subjectivity: doubt, emotion, will, impersonal opinion. Memorize WEIRDO triggers: Wishes (Quiero que estudies), Emotions (Me alegra que vengas), Impersonal expressions (Es necesario que duermas), Recommendations (Sugiero que leas), Doubt/denial (Dudo que sea cierto), Ojalá (Ojalá que llueva). Forms: take the yo form, drop -o, add opposite ending vowels (-ar → -e, -er/-ir → -a). AP Language Use scores reward consistent, correct subjunctive use; missing subjunctive after a WEIRDO trigger costs points.",
