      "correctText": "llegues",
      "topic": "Subjunctive Triggers",
      "explanation": "Llegues is the present subjunctive of llegar (tú form). The trigger is Es importante que, an impersonal expression. To form: take the yo indicative (llego), drop -o, add subjunctive endings for -ar verbs: -e, -es, -e, -emos, -éis, -en. So: llegue, llegues, llegue, lleguemos, lleguéis, lleguen. Note the spelling change g → gu before -e to preserve the hard g sound. Similar spelling-change verbs: buscar (busques), pagar (pagues), empezar (empieces). AP Conventions scoring rewards correct spelling in subjunctive forms. Practice these high-frequency Es necesario que, Es bueno que, Es triste que triggers.",
