      "prompt": "Read this passage:\n\n'Maya had practiced the speech for weeks, but standing now at the podium, the words sat in her throat like small, polished stones. She breathed in, and reminded herself that her grandmother had crossed an ocean with nothing in her pockets but courage.'\n\nWhich statement best identifies a central theme suggested by the passage?",
