      "prompt": "Read this passage:\n\n'The lighthouse stood as it always had — patient, alone, its single eye turning over the black water. Below, the keeper counted the pages of his last almanac and listened to a wind that did not answer him.'\n\nWhich phrase best captures the mood of this passage?",
