      "prompt": "Read this passage:\n\n'The town meeting had begun in shouts and ended in shouts, but in between there had been one moment — when Mrs. Alvarez stood up and read the names of the children — when even the loudest men remembered they had grown up here too.'\n\nWhich line provides the strongest textual evidence that the passage's central idea is about shared community memory tempering conflict?",
