      "correctText": "Harmless and inoffensive",
      "topic": "Vocabulary in Context",
      "explanation": "The clue is that 'even the most argumentative' members had nothing to object to. A recommendation that draws no objections is harmless and bland — the meaning of 'innocuous.'",
      "domain": "Practice Exam",
      "gradeBand": "Multi",
