      "correctText": "On weekends, Mira enjoys hiking, swimming, and reading mystery novels.",
      "topic": "Writing + Language: Grammar + Usage",
      "explanation": "Parallel structure requires items in a list to share the same grammatical form. Three gerunds — hiking, swimming, reading — are parallel. Mixing infinitives ('to read') breaks parallelism.",
