      "correctText": "Each of the players has a locker assigned for the season.",
      "topic": "Writing + Language: Grammar + Usage",
      "explanation": "The subject is 'Each,' which is singular, not the plural object of the preposition ('players'). A singular subject takes a singular verb: 'has,' not 'have' or 'are.'",
