      "explanation": "Supporting details are facts, examples, statistics, and descriptions that prove or explain the main idea. NYS Grade 5 ELA State Test 2-point short responses require TWO cited supporting details. Strategy: after stating the main idea, hunt for specific numbers, names, dates, or examples in the passage to cite as evidence. Always pair main idea with at least two supporting details for top rubric credit.",
