      "explanation": "A definition is a precise explanation of a key term's meaning, central to informative writing because readers need shared vocabulary to follow the topic. Strong Grade 7 informative essays define unfamiliar terms early, often using context clues, restatements, or formal definitions ('Photosynthesis, the process by which...'). NYS Grade 7 ELA standard W.7.2.d tests definition use directly; the 4-point rubric awards full credit when students provide accurate, accessible definitions of domain-specific vocabulary and integrate them smoothly into their writing rather than stopping the flow with dictionary lookups.",
