      "topic": "Language Conventions + Vocabulary (L)",
      "explanation": "'Claim' has several common meanings, but in an academic/essay context the relevant meaning is the writer's central assertion — the thing the supporting evidence is supposed to prove. The phrase 'supports it with three independent studies' makes the academic sense unmistakable.",
      "domain": "Practice Exam",
      "gradeBand": "Multi",
      "subjectArea": "Review",
      "standardRefs": [],
