      "prompt": "Read the sentence below.<br><br><em>\"The biologist studied the <strong>symbiotic</strong> relationship between the clownfish and the sea anemone, in which the fish gains protection from predators while the anemone gains scraps of food.\"</em><br><br>Based on context, <strong>symbiotic</strong> most nearly means:",
