      "correctText": "The eighth graders returned the library books before the field trip.",
      "topic": "Language Conventions + Vocabulary (L)",
      "explanation": "Active voice puts the agent (eighth graders) in the subject position and the receiver (library books) in the object position. Choice B does exactly that while preserving meaning. The other options either add ungrammatical constructions or remove the agent entirely.",
      "domain": "Practice Exam",
      "gradeBand": "Multi",
      "subjectArea": "Review",
