      "explanation": "King wrote his letter on margins of newspapers and scraps of paper smuggled into his Birmingham cell after his April 1963 arrest. The physical conditions of composition (no library access, no typewriter) make King's theological and historical command of citation more remarkable. RI.9-10.6 covers context shaping rhetoric. Regents Part 3 source-based argument essays sometimes test contextual awareness. AP Lang rewards essays that note rhetorical situation factors.",
