      "correctText": "So what conclusion",
      "topic": "Sensory Detail",
      "explanation": "The 'so what' conclusion explains why the topic matters in a broader context beyond the essay itself. Weak conclusions paraphrase the thesis; strong conclusions extend its significance. W.9-10.2f explicitly requires a concluding statement that 'follows from and supports the information or explanation presented.' Regents Part 3 source-based argument essays and Part 4 text-analysis writing both reward 'so what' conclusions. AP Lang argument and rhetorical analysis essays score sophistication via meaningful conclusions.",
